":"person","person_id":"8gq_slb_ulu","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"w9t_rdt_ue0","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"瞽叟","kind":"person","person_id":"8gq_slb_ulu","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"象","kind":"person","person_id":"a00_ney_bf4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"象","kind":"person","person_id":"a00_ney_bf4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"瞽叟","kind":"person","person_id":"8gq_slb_ulu","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"後妻","kind":"person","person_id":"p0q_m9t_btu","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m019-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"後母","kind":"person","person_id":"p0q_m9t_btu","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p020","text":"舜，冀州之人也。舜耕歷山，漁雷澤，陶河濱，作什器於壽丘，就時於負夏。舜父瞽叟頑，母嚚，弟象傲，皆欲殺舜。舜順適不失子道，兄弟孝慈。欲殺，不可得；即求，嘗在側。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"瞽叟","kind":"person","person_id":"8gq_slb_ulu","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"象","kind":"person","person_id":"a00_ney_bf4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m020-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-001","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p021","text":"舜年二十以孝聞。三十而帝堯問可用者，四嶽咸薦虞舜，曰可。於是堯乃以二女妻舜以觀其內，使九男與處以觀其外。舜居嬀汭，內行彌謹。堯二女不敢以貴驕事舜親戚，甚有婦道。堯九男皆益篤。舜耕歷山，歷山之人皆讓畔；漁雷澤，雷澤上人皆讓居；陶河濱，河濱器皆不苦窳。一年而所居成聚，二年成邑，三年成都。堯乃賜舜絺衣與琴，爲筑倉廩，予牛羊。瞽叟尚復欲殺之，使舜上塗廩，瞽叟從下縱火焚廩。舜乃以兩笠自扞而下，去，得不死。後瞽叟又使舜穿井，舜穿井爲匿空旁出。舜既入深，瞽叟與象共下土實井，舜從匿空出，去。瞽叟、象喜，以舜爲已死。象曰：「本謀者象。」象與其父母分，於是曰：「舜妻堯二女與琴，象取之；牛羊倉廩，予父母。」象乃止舜宮居，鼓其琴。舜往見之。象鄂不懌，曰：「我思舜正鬱陶！」舜曰：「然，爾其庶矣！」舜復事瞽叟，愛弟彌謹。於是堯乃試舜五典百官，皆治。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m021-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m021-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"帝堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m021-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"四嶽","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"可能為個人、官職、群體、氏族或國號；不憑本篇未明示的外部對應補造身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m021-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"虞舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m021-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m021-0033"